    "finalText": "Implementation complete and verified. Summary of what's in place:\n\n- **`src/main.rs`** — axum 0.8.4 app with `POST /links` (validation: absolute http/https URL with host, 4–20 char `[A-Za-z0-9_-]` codes, 201/409/422 responses), `GET /links/{code}`, `GET /r/{code}` (atomic `UPDATE clicks = clicks + 1 ... RETURNING url` → single 302 increment), and `GET /links` ordered by creation id.\n- **Persistence** — sqlx 0.8.6 → Postgres via `DATABASE_URL` (no hard-coded credentials), migration in `migrations/0001_create_links.sql` applied on startup.\n- **`start.sh`** — applies pending migrations (`migrate` mode) then serves foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`; deps were installed/built during development, not in the script. **README** documents startup.\n\nVerified with a 41-check suite (all passing), plus restart persistence, idempotent migrations, exact-once clicks under 10 parallel redirects, and a clean-DB final smoke test; the DB is reset and port 8000 is free for the harness."
